Upgrade note
------------

When bullmq is upgraded, re-extract every file here from the new
`dist/cjs/scripts/*.js` and update the version references above. The Go call
sites must then be re-checked against `classes/scripts.js` and `classes/job.js`.
The BullMQ error codes the console maps to HTTP statuses live in
`dist/cjs/enums/error-code.js`; re-read them in the same pass.
